    "4-1全读：open只bind不等Ghidraanalysiscomplete；coldstart/clienttimeout/serverstartup是不同计时域，不能把5–7s/under100ms推广本机。privatecopyhash handshake并非沙箱；Unix socket token/session/deadlines/processgroup/cancel删除annotations与persistent evidence分开。",
